WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:02.790
It's here!

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.190
It's here! Here! Here! Here! Here!

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.150
It's here! Here! Here!

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.050
So much for my day off...

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.010
I'm beat after spending the 
whole day baby-sitting!

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.860
Did you have fun baby-sitting?

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.480
No, not at all!

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.030
It wasn't the least bit fun.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.850
I'm exhausted as well.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.430
Yeah. Kei, didn't you 
two have work lined up?

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:23.790
Next time you and Izuru can do it!

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.250
Police Chief for 1 Day

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:25.480
You can be chiefs for a day,

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.880
play with kids,

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.710
and get your pictures 
taken in swim trunks!

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.110
Not another word!

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.510
Izuru, what were you up to?

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:33.880
I was-

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:34.740
It's here! It's here! It's here!

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:35.590
Oh, Suruga.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:37.850
Tell us later.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:39.240
IT'S HERE!

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.220
What is?

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.950
The new one!

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:43.600
New dried sea-ear wrapped around squid?

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.980
NO! It's a new AHSMB!

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:47.780
It's the new AHSMB model!

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:24.820
"The Aloof Ace"

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:42.320
Ain't it awesome?

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:45.550
Did they level up the unit's firepower?

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:47.350
It also has superior mobility.

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.560
It's big and black...

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:51.670
And sparkly...

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.250
What type of review is that?

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:56.000
As part of the New 
Self-Maintenance Plan,

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.930
Black 6 used our AHSMB 
data as the foundation-

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.790
So, who's gonna pilot this puppy?

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.490
Your underclassman.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:07.560
This would is your new 
team member, Kuroki Ange.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.600
A hot guy!

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.600
A hot girl!

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:10.080
Which is it?

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:14.470
Ange, allow me to introduce 
the members of Team Rabbits.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.070
This is your leader, Izuru.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:19.260
And this is Asagi, 
Suruga, Kei and Tamaki.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.930
It-it's...a pleasure to meet you...

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:26.720
Sirs.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.810
Have you worked out Black 6's pit crew?

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.020
Black 6's pilot will be its pit crew.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:41.360
It's so highly automated that it 
doesn't require a specialized pit crew.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.800
Naturally, the ground crew will 
handle its regular maintenance.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:44.780
Makes sense...

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.610
If we're going to mass produce AHSMBs,

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:48.370
we have to simplify maintenance first.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.780
Currently, the AHSMB are the

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:51.870
only thing that can fight 
on par with the Wulgaru.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:55.290
We worked ourselves to the bone 
to get this new model done ASAP.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.860
You don't look happy.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:58.730
Well, yeah...

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.500
This means you'll have 
to send an increasing

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.230
number of your students 
to the frontlines.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.910
Hasn't the new pilot arrived?

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.620
I'll introduce you later.

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:15.540
But I'm worried about how everyone 
is going to take to this new kid...

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:17.920
He called us, "Sirs!"

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:21.440
Dang, we've gotta be sure to teach 
her all of the ins and outs!

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.700
So, is that a male or a female?

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:25.780
Are you curious?

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:30.080
Nah, I couldn't care less.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.520
A welcoming party...

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.510
Why don't we hold a 
welcoming party to help

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:35.870
the new recruit feel at home?

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:37.310
Why should we?

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.520
Why not?

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.380
I think it's a good idea, Izuru.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.210
Totally!

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.650
I'm in!

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:44.990
I'll bake the cake!

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:50.790
Putting the cake aside, 
I should go invite Ange.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.750
Why are you putting that aside? Well?

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.930
We're holding it right now?

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.290
I'll go get him!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.220
Same!

00:04:57.220 --> 00:04:58.740
No, this role should go to...

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:03.530
I should ask him for a 
fresh take on my series!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.050
Uh, um, Officer Ange!

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.480
Do you have a minute...?

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:16.960
Why don't you come in?

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.190
Sir, have a seat...

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.290
Uh, so I was thinking-

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.390
Right! I was thinking the same thing.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:37.390
Let's...

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.680
...have one right away.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:42.610
One what?

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.320
A mock battle.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:46.780
What?!

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:50.850
I've been following your 
battles at the academy.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:53.580
I'd love to personally duel each of you.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.700
Please!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:59.170
Why the heck are you two 
holding a mock battle?!

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.170
It just sorta worked out that way...

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.650
How did it "work out" that way?

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:04.980
Hey, it's all cool!

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:07.270
I've been wanting to 
see Black 6 in action!

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:09.340
I can't believe you agreed to 
that without authorization!

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:13.740
But I couldn't turn him down!

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:15.790
A mock battle?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.110
Right. They'd like to see the

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.620
new recruit's abilities before 
entering actual combat.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:21.500
Very well.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:22.560
Are you sure?

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.490
I wanted to confirm the new AHSMB 
model's maneuverability myself.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.750
Now we get to see what he's got, huh?

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.770
Hang in there, Ange!

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.500
Good luck, Ange!

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.170
Best of luck, Izuru...

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:51.240
How do you fight in a mo-

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:51.720
Mock battle, start!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:03.920
Wow, she's good!

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:04.750
Impressive!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.090
Too cool!

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:08.190
What the heck?! She's 
taking this too seriously!

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.190
What's with this onslaught?!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.390
She's fast!

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:17.870
He's overpowering Izuru...

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.230
Officer... Ange...?

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.130
You were great.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.920
It's reassuring to know 
that we have a pilot like

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.150
you on the team.

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.120
Honestly, I was dropping 
by your room to invite

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.760
you to a welcoming party.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:53.540
If you like-

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.070
I don't need a welcoming party.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:58.510
I was born to fight.

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:00.910
Aside from fighting, 
I don't need anything.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:02.100
Ummm...?

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:02.770
Move.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:05.210
What is that?

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:10.610
I was hoping a new pair of 
eyes could look over it...

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:23.010
Your theme is stale and your 
story lacks excitement.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:25.750
Your panels are poorly blocked 
and the designs are a mess.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:27.460
Bluntly put, it sucks.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:29.150
It's just like you.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.860
What was that battle today?

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:34.190
It was pathetic!

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:35.190
Stop right there!

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:36.070
How dare you!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.190
Wh-what was I doing...?

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:45.810
I'm sorry!

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:50.180
Officer Ange, we're holding a 
welcoming part in the mess hall!

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:54.200
I'm the one who should apologize...

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.430
Thank you, Kei.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.730
Did you actually invite him?

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.860
It wasn't much of an invitation...

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.040
Maybe she's really shy...

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.570
Ange must be the super shy type.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.890
Should I go fetch Ange?

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:19.950
This might conflict with his 
schedule or something...

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:23.480
Going by this, do you think we're 
going to work well together?

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.310
After the Battle of Ceres,

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:31.250
the Wulgaru have been going 
around destroying our bases

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.570
on 2493 Elmer and 1272 Gefion.

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:36.420
We expect them to strike 4 Vesta next.

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:38.110
We have a supply base located there.

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:39.710
It would appear that a 
Wulgaru reconnaissance

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.100
unit has already located the base.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:45.650
This is where the GDF has been 
extracting Helium-3 and water.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.500
We will suffer a tremendous 
loss if we lose this base.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.520
We must defend it at all cost!

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:54.010
Increasing backup engine's output.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:55.990
Activating the turbine's 
activation sequence.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:56.340
Disconnect all equipment.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:57.820
All hatches are closed.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.430
External power has been established.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.430
APU activated.

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:03.140
External pressure increasing.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.680
Main engine, military!

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.290
Blast off!

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:14.190
Not another mission.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.860
Where are we headed this time?

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.730
Now that your team is 
stronger than ever,

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.850
I am sending you on a new mission.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:33.420
Commence Operation: Iouto!

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:39.000
Godinion, enter Combat Formation I.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.200
Main control: Move CIC.

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.480
Navi bridge: Closed.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:50.980
Bulkhead: Locked.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:53.440
Whole control room: Move complete.

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:54.340
Completed.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.260
We get to see the new 
AHSMB in actual combat...

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.370
Think it'll be okay without 
its own specialized crew?

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:32.110
It's automatized, so it 
doesn't need the likes of us.

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:34.290
Don't make me depressed!

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:38.550
Pick up the pace, primitive creatures!

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:42.380
How is attacking my dust cloud 
gonna save your butts, slowpokes?

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:44.030
What is it?

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:48.090
Legatus Klein, it would appear that 
those units are headed our way.

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:49.890
Yeah? Cool!

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:53.310
We'll break off the assault on 
the base and prepare an ambush!

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:05.720
Sulfur is emitted around the Vesta 
Base, creating poor visibility.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:09.760
Furthermore, it would appear that 
there are also some sulfur geysers.

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:11.080
Bear that in mind when on the move.

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:14.790
The enemy strikes in 
swift, tight formations.

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:18.000
First, focus on breaking 
their formation.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:19.960
Rose 3, that's your job.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.480
Got it!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:24.270
Purple 2, ascertain the enemies' 
movements and report them

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:25.380
to the rest of the team.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.420
Yes, Ma'am!

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:29.370
Once Rose 3 charges in, Blue 1, Red 5

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:32.140
and Black 6 are to attack 
from different directions.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.100
Red 5 will issue the orders. Understood?

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:35.100
Roger! Yes, Ma'am!

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.850
Hey, Officer Ange? Are you okay?

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:41.270
Uh, yeah...

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:43.730
All units will reach 4 
Vesta in 180 seconds.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.370
I can't see the Wulgaru's 
enemy fighters...

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:47.530
Where on Earth did they go?

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:49.470
Is the sulfur jamming our sensors?

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:50.990
Should I increase their sensitivity?

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.410
Purple 2, can you sense them?

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:54.890
I'll try.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.480
I knew it...

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:06.050
They're here.

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.260
But where?!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.880
I can't see a thing through this sulfur!

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:14.930
Asagi's AHSMB reacted before he did!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.750
Its evasive skills are still 
on a league of its own, huh?

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.710
Do you think Ange'll be okay?

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:21.400
This is his first real battle...

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:26.110
You'll be fine, Officer 
Ange! Just keep calm.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.610
Uh, right...

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.490
Where'd the enemy go?

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:36.500
It's so quiet. I don't like it.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:37.950
Kei, find them yet?

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:39.240
Wait.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:42.790
Over to your three o'clock!

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:44.620
Then I'm off!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.650
Wait! There isn't much 
noise out that way!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:47.710
The main unit is-!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:49.340
To our right!

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:51.010
This was a decoy?!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:53.120
Wulgaru formation in the 
10 o'clock direction.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:53.930
Several fighters are approaching!

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:56.510
I'll pick off that one first!

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:06.860
Red 5 and Blue 1, offer 
Purple 2 support!

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:10.590
Damn it! I can't move.

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.030
We've gotta get past these guys!

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:26.150
Miss!

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:27.840
Her IE gyro is toast!

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:29.820
Purple 2 is hit!

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:31.260
This doesn't look good.

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:53.650
I can't hit 'em!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:56.740
Asagi, take care of Kei!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:57.770
You got it!

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.740
I have your back!

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:03.730
Officer Ange! Officer Ange, 
help Asagi defend Kei!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:16.930
I can't get near Kei!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.230
Hit home! Hit those freaks!

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:30.180
Officer Ange! Officer Ange!

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:32.090
Hurry and help Kei!

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.220
Ange, can't you move?

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:35.530
Ange? Ange?!

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:47.830
Black 6 has begun moving.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:49.750
He's ignoring the team's formation!

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:01.560
What's this?!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:03.570
And here I was gonna save it for last!

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:05.020
I'll hunt you down first!

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:07.330
The enemy units are 
headed toward Black 6.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.240
Is he going to take them on by himself?!

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:12.440
Black 6, pull back! Black 6!

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:13.860
I'm gonna crush them all!

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:16.600
I'll turn them into scrap metal!

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:29.000
I'm gonna make this my lamata!

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:50.880
I'm not done yet!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.410
Officer Ange, don't chase after him!

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:08.210
He's movin' too fast!

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:12.130
Don't chase him too far!
 Pull back, Officer Ange!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.170
Ange, above you!

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.830
Quit naggin' at me 
over every damn thing!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.910
And don't tell me what to do!

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.340
Shut the hell up and watch!

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:29.230
Black 6 is still pursuing the enemy.

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:32.150
Black 6's Harmonic 
Levels are increasing!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:40.790
Who knew one of those primitive 
creatures could keep up with me...

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:46.410
I think I'll take advantage of that.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.820
Ange, you shouldn't pursue 
the enemy by yourself!

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:59.420
That's right! Keep hot on my heels!

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:05.260
Black 6, cease pursuit of the enemy!

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:06.480
That's a-

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:13.230
Ange!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:18.930
You probably think I've fallen 
for some trap, but keep dreaming!

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:21.200
There's no way your shitty 
excuse for brains

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.860
could devise an intelligent 
plan, you damn swine!

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.190
Harmonic Levels are still increasing!

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.620
This is the highest 
level we've ever seen.

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:43.300
You're a friggin' pig 
with nothin' but speed!

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:46.140
Did you think you could beat 
me off of speed alone?!

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.230
You're a worthless numbskull!

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:51.360
Who is this person...?

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:53.340
That's Ange, isn't it?

00:20:53.340 --> 00:20:55.190
That verbal onslaught...

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.560
Just listening to him makes me dizzy.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.610
Go to hell!

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:18.220
FRIGGIN' DIE!

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:22.760
My lamata-!

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:33.160
A swine's subordinates are swine!

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.690
Anyone part of that freak's 
formation are freaks!

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:38.420
Damn Wulgaru! I hope you go extinct!

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:40.480
Don't let me see your 
ugly hide ever again!

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:52.370
That one unit fought off 
their entire squad...

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:54.790
Is that his real personality?

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.460
So it would seem.

00:21:56.770 --> 00:21:59.630
Uh, is that how he always acted?

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:02.880
I'm struck speechless, 
in more ways than one.

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:56.040
"AHSMB's Shadow"
